<v Chris Benderev>[音乐播放]

00:22:54.660 --> 00:23:00.260
<v Chris Benderev>And he ends his set with a song about how all his friends with kids are miserable and boring now.
<v Chris Benderev>他以一首关于他那些有孩子的朋友如今变得多么悲惨、多么无聊的歌结束了他的表演。

