00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:53.660
<v Michael>So the minute the word "kids" came up, I went on high alert. And I just had a feeling, oh, my god, we're sitting in the front row. Is he going to come to us?
<v Michael>听到“孩子”这个词的瞬间，我就进入了戒备状态。我心里有种预感：“天哪，我们就坐在前排。他会走过来吗？”

